  "decisions": [
    "The ordinary weapon attack uses the authored Repeating heavy crossbow's 80/320 profile and 1d10 piercing weapon die.",
    "One loaded bolt is spent for every legal rolled attack, hit or miss; illegal attacks and an empty magazine spend no bolt.",
    "A hit rolls one weapon d10 or two on a critical, then adds Dexterity once; the output is explicitly before defense/application.",
    "Attack and hit-damage dice use one deterministic stream in source order; a miss consumes no damage dice."
  ],
